PROJECT DESCRIPTION\
\
This dataset represents consumer shopping behavior in the modern retail environment.\
\
Customers may prefer:\
1. Online shopping\
2. Physical store shopping\
3. Hybrid shopping\
\
The dataset includes demographic information, income levels, digital usage, and logistics preferences.\
\
The purpose of the dataset is to allow data scientists to explore shopping trends and build machine learning models to predict consumer behavior.\
\
Possible applications:\
- Marketing strategy\
- Personalized recommendations\
- Retail optimization\
- Customer segmentation}